{
    "title": "Baskin-Robbins",
    "description": "Get the (ice cream) party started. Order cakes, scoops, shakes, & more, access exclusive deals & offers, and experience Baskin-Robbins\u00ae at your fingertips. Trusted by over 4 million ice cream lovers, the Baskin-Robbins\u00ae App is here to help you sweeten every moment.\r\n\r\nORDER YOUR FAVES\r\nOrder your favorite treats \u2013 like scoops, sundaes, beverages, and more \u2013 for pick up in as little as 15 minutes, or seize the yay in an extra special way with a Baskin-Robbins\u00ae ice cream cake, available for ordering up to 30 days in advance. Customize with your favorite flavors & place your order right in the App.\r\n\r\nACCESS SWEET DEALS\r\nExclusive access to the latest & greatest updates, coupons, and deals. Can\u2019t wait for the sweet savings? Download today and enjoy a free regular scoop when you create an account.*\r\n\r\nPURCHASE IN-SHOP GIFT CARDS\r\nEnjoy a faster in-shop checkout experience. Add your existing Baskin-Robbins\u00ae gift card, scan at the register, and enjoy. No existing gift card? No problem \u2013 add and manage virtual gift cards directly through the BR App. Checking out has never been cooler.\r\n\r\nCELEBRATE MORE EVENTS\r\nAt Baskin-Robbins\u00ae, we believe there\u2019s always a reason to celebrate. Stay on top of our favorite events and holidays, or create and manage your own. We\u2019ll remind you about upcoming birthday parties, anniversaries, play dates, or any other reason you find to celebrate.\r\n\r\nFIND A SHOP\r\nIce cream emergency? We get it. Finding the closest Baskin-Robbins\u00ae is always just a tap away. Speed up your pickup when you order ahead \u2013 future you will thank you.\r\n\r\nSEND A MOBILE GIFT CARD\r\nInstantly send mobile gift cards to the people who matter most. Choose a design in the app, then text or email to make someone\u2019s day.\r\n\r\nBROWSE THE MENU\r\nStay up to date on new ice cream flavors, seasonal treats, and nutrition information.\r\n\r\n*Terms and conditions apply",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get the (ice cream) party started. Order cakes, scoops, shakes, &amp; more, access exclusive deals &amp; offers, and experience Baskin-Robbins\u00ae at your fingertips. Trusted by over 4 million ice cream lovers, the Baskin-Robbins\u00ae App is here to help you sweeten every moment.<br><br>ORDER YOUR FAVES<br>Order your favorite treats \u2013 like scoops, sundaes, beverages, and more \u2013 for pick up in as little as 15 minutes, or seize the yay in an extra special way with a Baskin-Robbins\u00ae ice cream cake, available for ordering up to 30 days in advance. Customize with your favorite flavors &amp; place your order right in the App.<br><br>ACCESS SWEET DEALS<br>Exclusive access to the latest &amp; greatest updates, coupons, and deals. Can\u2019t wait for the sweet savings? Download today and enjoy a free regular scoop when you create an account.*<br><br>PURCHASE IN-SHOP GIFT CARDS<br>Enjoy a faster in-shop checkout experience. Add your existing Baskin-Robbins\u00ae gift card, scan at the register, and enjoy. No existing gift card? No problem \u2013 add and manage virtual gift cards directly through the BR App. Checking out has never been cooler.<br><br>CELEBRATE MORE EVENTS<br>At Baskin-Robbins\u00ae, we believe there\u2019s always a reason to celebrate. Stay on top of our favorite events and holidays, or create and manage your own. We\u2019ll remind you about upcoming birthday parties, anniversaries, play dates, or any other reason you find to celebrate.<br><br>FIND A SHOP<br>Ice cream emergency? We get it. Finding the closest Baskin-Robbins\u00ae is always just a tap away. Speed up your pickup when you order ahead \u2013 future you will thank you.<br><br>SEND A MOBILE GIFT CARD<br>Instantly send mobile gift cards to the people who matter most. Choose a design in the app, then text or email to make someone\u2019s day.<br><br>BROWSE THE MENU<br>Stay up to date on new ice cream flavors, seasonal treats, and nutrition information.<br><br>*